Z||000006||fierospeeder||02-09-2000||11:22 PM||||My daddy pays for mine, but he doesn't really buy me stuff so i guess thats his present for bdays and xmas.<BR>All my cars are both owned by my dad and me so the insurance is lower and im going to turn 21 this month and they have reduced it already.  <BR>In illinois, if you get a speeding ticket, you can either pay more money and not get another speeding ticket within 4 months or pay more money and go to a 4 hour class and the ticket goes off your record.  It depends on the county wether or not you have to take class.||||reg||1
Z||000008||fierodave||02-10-2000||06:36 AM|||| I pay $256 for six and have three on the policy, <BR>two with full coverage, <BR>84 SE with just liability(uninsured & under insured)<BR>86 GT   (full)  <BR>84 Indy (full)  <P>Stated value policys worth $6,000 k each. and a $1,000.00 deductable  <P>Of coarse I have a suspension of my DL. from 1 1/2 years ago(forgot to pay a $10.00 seatbelt violation grrrrrrr)  and will be 41 this month.  FD||||reg||1
